OL,3,GNEWSAWellness group works to end
OL,4,Aisolation using coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation promoting what it calls
OL,7,F"blue health" is helping people end
OL,8,Fisolation by offering coastline
OL,9,Factivities, including a weekly walking
OL,10,Fgroup, a surf social group and
OL,11,Fcoasteering days.
OL,13,FCrystal Blue Adventures CIC (community
OL,14,Finterest company) said its activities
OL,15,Fcould be used by those who were maybe
OL,16,Fwidowed, divorced, unemployed or new to
OL,17,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
