OL,3,GNEWSAWellness group works to end
OL,4,Aisolation using coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirector Nick Webb said: "It's been a
OL,7,Freal game-changer for a lot of people
OL,8,Fin terms of their social group and
OL,9,Fsocial network and basically how they
OL,10,Ffeel at the end of the week.
OL,12,F"Our whole idea was all about using the
OL,13,Fcoast to get people out and about, as a
OL,14,Fcatalyst if you like."
